Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.73,0:00:06.69,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,How absolutely revolting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.07,0:00:10.11,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Not only do they constantly stand in the \Nway of our noble Eastern Expedition,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.11,0:00:16.12,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,they kidnap our heroes, \Nbesmirching humanity's glorious history.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:20.02,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,When they are mere barbarians, \Nliving beyond the light of civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:24.89,Main,Radil,0,0,0,,It's the bird again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.89,0:00:28.13,Main,Aleks,0,0,0,,But we can't put up much of \Na fight with this equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:41.65,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Fear not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.65,0:00:47.32,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,We carry with us the most \Npotent of God's miracles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.32,0:00:49.77,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,More than enough to vanquish some beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.77,0:00:52.70,Main,Radil,0,0,0,,Be that as it may, \NRetinue Priest Malcius,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:55.65,Main,Radil,0,0,0,,if we don't resupply soon, \Nour chances of surviving...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.65,0:00:57.35,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,You want to run back to base, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.18,0:01:00.77,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,You gentlemen are knights \Nof the Eastern Expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:03.00,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,I thought that meant honorable,\Ndistinguished service.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.43,0:01:04.79,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,But if your efforts
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:07.77,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,end in no better results than the \Nexpedition from 20 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.96,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,There is only one way to avoid such shame:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.45,0:01:19.29,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,the rescue of Lady Serafina de Lavillant!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.29,0:01:21.47,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,For both your honor as knights
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.47,0:01:23.43,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,and so that the The Order of Commoneras
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.43,0:01:27.00,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,can see our long-held dream \Nof eastern conquest fulfilled!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:53.51,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(2500,1725)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&HFAFDFE&\3c&H3D6671&\4c&H372771&\shad2}T{\c&HF8FCFD&}h{\c&HF6FBFC&}e{\c&HF4FAFB&} {\c&HF2F9FA&}W{\c&HF1F8FA&}a{\c&HEFF7F9&}r{\c&HEDF6F8&}r{\c&HEBF5F7&}i{\c&HE9F4F6&}o{\c&HE7F3F5&}r{\c&HE5F2F4&} {\c&HE3F1F3&}P{\c&HE2F0F3&}r{\c&HE0EFF2&}i{\c&HDEEEF1&}n{\c&HDCEDF0&}c{\c&HDAECEF&}e{\c&HD8EBEE&}s{\c&HD6EAED&}s{\c&HD4E9EC&} {\c&HD3E7EC&}a{\c&HD1E6EB&}n{\c&HCFE5EA&}d{\c&HCDE4E9&} {\c&HCBE3E8&}t{\c&HC9E2E7&}h{\c&HC7E1E6&}e{\c&HC5E0E5&} {\c&HC4DFE5&}B{\c&HC2DEE4&}a{\c&HC0DDE3&}r{\c&HBEDCE2&}b{\c&HBCDBE1&}a{\c&HBADAE0&}r{\c&HB8D9DF&}i{\c&HB6D8DE&}c{\c&HB5D7DE&} {\c&HB3D6DD&}K{\c&HB1D5DC&}i{\c&HAFD4DB&}n{\c&HADD3DA&}g
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.81,0:03:24.60,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,What a fine edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:27.80,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,That should do for today's firewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:29.85,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Really? We're done already?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.11,0:03:34.98,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,You say that, but in the past three \Ndays, you've cut two weeks' worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.39,0:03:38.81,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,If all I do is eat and sleep, \Nmy body will lose its edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.81,0:03:42.74,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,And I obviously want to familiarize \Nmyself with such a fine weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.36,0:03:47.00,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Should I take that to mean your \Nrestlessness from the past few days
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:49.62,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,has been due to boredom, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:54.10,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,So much time without any \Nmeetings or exercise...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.10,0:03:57.50,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,is quite the change of pace \Nfrom how my life used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:04:01.52,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,And yet, you've never helped \Nwith household tasks before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.52,0:04:07.41,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Honestly, I should have done my share \Nof that sort of thing as a squire...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.15,0:04:10.55,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,But my grandfather
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.55,0:04:13.94,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,apparently put some degree of pressure \Non the knight I apprenticed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:17.90,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,The idea of a major noble bending \Nthe rules like that is scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.19,0:04:22.13,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Well, I doubt you'll be bored today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.70,0:04:25.31,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Considering... Oh, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.37,0:04:35.92,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Hey, Sera! Care to spar with \Nthe village's warriors?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.73,0:04:44.55,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,He mentioned some bright idea he \Nhad to resolve your frustration.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.55,0:04:47.09,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting something \Nso... meat-headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:50.93,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Look how many of them there are! \NI can't just send them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.93,0:04:52.85,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Oh, well!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:54.56,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Speaking of meatheads...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.82,0:04:58.56,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sorry, Cersei, but could \Nyou bring Sera's armor out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:05:01.32,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Sure! Just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:08.06,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You had my armor all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:11.90,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Once it was off of you, \NI wiped the blood and mud away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:14.43,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,but I've only done the bare \Nminimum of daily maintenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:16.58,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,No. That should suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.56,0:05:24.09,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I suppose the helmet couldn't be fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.39,0:05:26.55,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,I'll help you put it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.55,0:05:28.26,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You know how?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:30.25,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,More or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.25,0:05:33.47,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Considering I was the \None who took it off you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:37.99,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Most can't remove and equip\N armor without experience...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.17,0:05:54.61,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I apologize for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:57.50,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I am a knight commander of \Nthe kingdom of Illdoren...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:06:01.17,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,But you know me better \Nas the Crystal Helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.89,0:06:03.50,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Let's see if you can \Nalleviate my boredom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.46,0:06:09.75,Main,Soldier A,0,0,0,,Getting to fight the Crystal Helmet... \NIt's like a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.75,0:06:11.76,Main,Raham,0,0,0,,Me! I wanna go first!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.03,0:06:13.74,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,There's no need to rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.27,0:06:17.77,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,We'll be doing this \Nwith wooden swords, Sera.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:20.89,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I thought as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.27,0:06:29.54,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Our first challenge for the famous \NCrystal Helmet is the young warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:33.19,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,who experienced battle for the first \Ntime in the most recent conflict...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.19,0:06:37.04,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Warrior Raham, son of \NGamelan, the Blue Fang!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:43.04,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Comport yourselves with honor, and begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:45.07,Main,Raham,0,0,0,,Don't hold back on my account!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.08,0:06:50.85,Main,Gamelan,0,0,0,,Raham!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.85,0:06:53.55,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,He said not to hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.77,0:06:56.56,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Next is Gamelan the Blue Fang!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.56,0:06:59.63,Main,Gamelan,0,0,0,,I will avenge my boy's little boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.63,0:07:02.38,Main,Gamelan,0,0,0,,as his father!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.30,0:07:06.35,Main,Gamelan,0,0,0,,My own little boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.74,0:07:06.35,Main - Top,Raham,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.35,0:07:09.57,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,You both fight the same way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:12.41,Main,Sero,0,0,0,,Let me go next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.41,0:07:15.45,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Very well. Next is Two-Necked Sero!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.82,0:07:18.93,Main,Sero,0,0,0,,Crystal Helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:21.27,Main,Sero,0,0,0,,First, I want thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.70,0:07:24.88,Main,Sero,0,0,0,,When the Tsukebikeshi \Nattacked the village...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.64,0:07:28.36,Main,Sero,0,0,0,,you protected my sister and nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:31.47,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,They're your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.69,0:07:35.14,Main,Sero,0,0,0,,I'm grateful that you kept \NYufa and Gatar alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:38.47,Main,Sero,0,0,0,,That said, the spar's a separate matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.73,0:07:40.40,Main,Sero,0,0,0,,Show no restraint!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.40,0:07:41.35,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.34,0:07:43.18,Main,Sero,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.75,0:07:54.27,Main,Cyclops Armor,0,0,0,,Gamelan and Sero were both \Ntaken down with ease!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.74,0:07:57.37,Main,Tsukebikeshi Armor,0,0,0,,Now I'm really fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:07.14,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Sh-She's so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:09.52,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,These are all skilled warriors, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.52,0:08:14.13,Main,Vyu,0,0,0,,Well, considering how much willpower \NIlldoren is using, it's no surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.55,0:08:18.91,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Lady Vyufumec, Master Veor \Nexplained it to me before
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.91,0:08:21.64,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,but I'm still not sure \Nwhat this "willpower" is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.94,0:08:24.27,Main,Vyufumec,0,0,0,,It's not that complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:33.05,Main,Vyufumec,0,0,0,,Willpower is just what it sounds \Nlike; the strength of one's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:36.41,Main,Vyufumec,0,0,0,,Their desire to achieve something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.91,0:08:39.83,Main,Vyufumec,0,0,0,,Birds being able to fly, \Nfish being able to swim,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:43.42,Main,Vyufumec,0,0,0,,dragons being powerful, \Nwe Tefyu being as free as we are,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.42,0:08:45.01,Main,Vyufumec,0,0,0,,it all comes from the same source.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.57,0:08:51.92,Main,Vyufumec,0,0,0,,We Tefyu don't have flowing \Nblood or bodies of flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:57.62,Main,Vyufumec,0,0,0,,We're sort of the living dreams of the \Nwind, water, clouds, earth, and flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.78,0:09:03.14,Main,Vyufumec,0,0,0,,The Ixt, Quefto, and Kufuwek \Nall have bodies of flesh,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.14,0:09:05.01,Main,Vyufumec,0,0,0,,but have long, long lifespans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.83,0:09:11.69,Main,Vyufumec,0,0,0,,But... the Cornem live \Nfor such a short time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.06,0:09:17.44,Main,Vyufumec,0,0,0,,With not nearly enough time to \Naccomplish the things they want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:22.62,Main,Vyufumec,0,0,0,,Which is why Cornem warriors have \Nsuch strong, strong willpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:27.12,Main,Vyufumec,0,0,0,,It sharpens their technique, \Nincreases their strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:28.96,Main,Vyufumec,0,0,0,,and gives life to \Ntheir fighting techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.21,0:09:33.71,Main,Vyufumec,0,0,0,,And techniques strengthened with willpower\Ncan only be contested with willpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.09,0:09:37.93,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Then if their martial and \Nphysical prowess are both equal,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.93,0:09:41.05,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,it's willpower that determines \Nwho wins a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.05,0:09:42.22,Main,Vyu,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.22,0:09:46.85,Main,Vyu,0,0,0,,That powerful desire to accomplish \Nsomething in their brief lives...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.35,0:09:51.86,Main,Vyu,0,0,0,,It's something that seems truly \Ndazzling to the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:54.69,Main,Vyu,0,0,0,,It almost seems to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.43,0:10:09.85,Main,Sero,0,0,0,,It's a draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.83,0:10:15.63,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,It seems I didn't manage to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.63,0:10:21.14,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Seeing how I lost last time, \NI could hardly risk doing so again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:25.84,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,What? Are you still worried \Nabout what I said the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.84,0:10:27.64,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.01,0:10:30.65,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,But how about it? Did that \Nhelp ease your boredom?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.65,0:10:34.23,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Yeah! I'm feeling pretty \Nrelieved right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:35.65,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,And I have you to thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:41.32,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,And this after they were fighting \Nseriously seconds ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.67,0:10:44.85,Main,Vyu,0,0,0,,Now, that was some lively willpower!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.85,0:10:47.04,Main,Vyu,0,0,0,,There's nothing I enjoy more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:49.70,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,A Tefyu being impressed \Nwith someone else's vigor...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.70,0:10:52.90,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Is that why you're visiting today?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:55.05,Main,Vyu,0,0,0,,Some booze would make \Nthe outing even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.05,0:10:58.05,Main,Lookout,0,0,0,,Hey! We've got trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.05,0:10:59.37,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.98,0:11:04.07,Main,Lookout,0,0,0,,We've got an injured Morisuberi heading \Nthis way from the western woods!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.07,0:11:05.31,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.62,0:11:08.14,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Is it another dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:24.32,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,From what I can tell, these dragon \Nattacks are out of the ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.70,0:11:30.14,Flashback,Cersei,0,0,0,,But it's strange. The Tsukebikeshi \Naround here don't approach villages.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.14,0:11:33.08,Flashback,Cersei,0,0,0,,They've learned how they'll \Nbe attacked, if they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:36.77,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,The Tsukebikeshi incident, and now this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.10,0:11:41.38,Flashback,Lookout,0,0,0,,From what the other lookouts tell \Nme, it's not just this Morisuberi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.38,0:11:44.69,Flashback,Lookout,0,0,0,,There's been a bunch of other dragons \Nthat have injuries from humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.09,0:11:46.57,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.57,0:11:51.60,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,No one who lives in these parts would \Nlet a wounded dragon get away...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:55.11,Flashback,Lookout,0,0,0,,Something bad is going \Non in the western woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:59.08,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,It's different from the intense \Nlook he has during battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:02.47,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to see \Nsuch a face on Veor...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.23,0:12:06.53,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I've got a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.31,0:12:09.12,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,It's beginning!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:26.05,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:34.31,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Now tie it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.41,0:12:37.31,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:38.57,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:49.12,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:58.51,Main,Gamelan,0,0,0,,The Crystal Helmet finished it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:08.11,Main,Daniel,0,0,0,,Hey, I could use some rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.11,0:13:09.96,Main,Mob 3,0,0,0,,What'll we do with the tail?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.96,0:13:12.14,Main,Gamelan,0,0,0,,It won't be enough, at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:14.19,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,That's one big dragon...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.19,0:13:15.72,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's a Morisuberi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.72,0:13:20.60,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Unlike the Tsukebikeshi and other flying \Ndragons, it's a type of True Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:24.04,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,True Dragons? What is the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:28.11,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,The number of legs. See how it has six?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.11,0:13:33.79,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,According to Ixt sages, \Nthe center pair used to be wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.43,0:13:38.04,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,In the distant past, \Nthey apparently flew via willpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.33,0:13:42.35,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Something this heavy used to fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.71,0:13:45.92,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,That really would be like a dragon \Nfrom out of a fantasy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:49.05,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,There are other breeds whose \Nwings are still intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.33,0:13:52.49,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,The Fire Dragon that dwells in the \NQuefto's mountains, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.49,0:13:55.55,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,That sounds even more fantastical.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.95,0:13:59.56,Main,Gamelan,0,0,0,,Hey! Come take a look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:02.57,Main,Gamelan,0,0,0,,Here's the wound we heard about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.82,0:14:06.24,Main,Gamelan,0,0,0,,It's a burn, but it \Nlooks odd, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:08.96,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's pretty deep, but there's \Nnot much soot at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.96,0:14:10.57,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Ordinary flame didn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:14.86,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It reminds me of the Rijutsu \Nthat the Ixt use...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.86,0:14:18.28,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Rijutsu? Is that some kind of magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.28,0:14:19.08,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:24.84,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Normally, for burns, it'd require some \Nsulfur or volcanic stone as a catalyst.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:29.22,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,But if that was the case, \Nthere'd be more charring...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:32.78,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera, are there people in the west \Nwho use this kind of sorcery?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.78,0:14:34.17,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,In Illdoren?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.17,0:14:37.85,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I can say for certain that no \None of these lands did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.85,0:14:42.26,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I can't think of anyone in the \NEastern Expedition who uses magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.75,0:14:46.66,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wait. Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.86,0:14:50.03,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Did someone come to mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.16,0:14:58.05,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,The clergy of the Order of Commoneras, \Nfrom the western kingdoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.55,0:15:02.19,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,A number of them have accompanied the \NEastern Expedition as retinue priests.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.21,0:15:06.67,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Their duty is to perform simple \Nmasses and funerary writes with the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.67,0:15:11.24,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,power of light in camps to soothe the \Nspirits of the eastern knights...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:17.13,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,But I've never heard of their miracles \Nhaving any combat potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.13,0:15:20.64,Main,Vyu,0,0,0,,Illdoren! Orkfiem! There's trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.64,0:15:25.90,Main,Vyu,0,0,0,,The Ixt have found the maniacs who've \Nbeen using Rijutsu without a catalyst!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:29.24,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Are they mad?! \NThey're actually doing such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.24,0:15:31.78,Main,Vyu,0,0,0,,And because of that, a blight \Nwill be showing up any time now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.38,0:15:33.40,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,A blight?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.06,0:15:36.08,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Hear me well, warriors!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.08,0:15:38.65,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Excluding those with second names,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.65,0:15:40.67,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I want half of you to collect \Nand clean the dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.05,0:15:44.29,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,The rest are to return to the village \Nand prepare for the worst-case scenario!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.94,0:15:48.03,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Those who have a second name, \Nbrace yourselves, and come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.02,0:15:52.30,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Veor, what are these blights?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.54,0:15:56.56,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Blights are what happens when \Nnatural law becomes stagnate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:15:59.80,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,They become antithetical to the natural \Nworld... Fiends, in other words.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.89,0:16:01.97,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Fiends?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:07.16,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,There is a type of monster... \Nwe call them Fiends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:09.23,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,As you live here, you'll \Nencounter them sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.23,0:16:12.07,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,They're a bit like a living disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.77,0:16:26.71,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,We cannot turn back after \Nhaving come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:29.82,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,No matter what price we must pay...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.70,0:16:32.85,Main,Vyu,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:55.25,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Malcius!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.77,0:16:59.78,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Retinue Priest Malcius!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.78,0:17:02.00,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Lady Serafina?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.52,0:17:06.51,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Lady Serafina! You're not hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:08.74,Main,Radil,0,0,0,,Lady Lavillant!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.66,0:17:13.63,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,They don't seem like they'd be completely \Nincompatible with our way of life...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:17.14,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera, do you know them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:20.26,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,She was the priest assigned to \Nmy First Division of knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.26,0:17:23.87,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,L-L-Lady Serafina!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:27.98,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,That savage! He's one\Nof those wretched barbarians!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:29.40,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,He needs to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.62,0:17:33.47,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Calm yourself, Malcius. \NDo not be so wantonly aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.57,0:17:34.90,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Consider your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.90,0:17:36.15,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,You say that, after all this time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.84,0:17:42.65,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,We have been warring for 700 years... \NThis is the 17th expedition!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.65,0:17:45.29,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Justice is with those of us from the east!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:48.54,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,How could the Lavillant \Nprincess have forgotten this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.54,0:17:55.73,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Did these lowborn creatures violate you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.73,0:17:57.80,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,No! It's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.09,0:18:00.59,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Damned barbarians!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:04.83,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Omgab! Feu louv! Vefshiv!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.83,0:18:06.18,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Am Fyuek!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.62,0:18:08.69,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Stop it! What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:09.77,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,In Vif!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.31,0:18:15.88,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,That must've been what \Ninjured the Morisuberi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.31,0:18:18.70,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Then the source of the commotion...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.70,0:18:22.21,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Did you see that, Lady Serafina?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.21,0:18:23.73,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,In these foul barbarian lands,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.73,0:18:28.08,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,God's miracles have grown \Nall the more potent!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.38,0:18:32.09,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,What could this prove other than our \Nrighteousness?! We are righteous!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:35.05,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Of all the asinine mistakes to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.72,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You should not take such pride
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.72,0:18:38.97,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,in absconding with the power \Nof the earth and the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.02,0:18:46.98,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Come, Lady Serafina. \NLet's return home together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.43,0:18:56.16,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.16,0:19:00.61,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Malcius, is it? For Sera's sake, \NI'm going to ask only once...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.83,0:19:03.06,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Can we not discuss this matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.06,0:19:06.21,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Stop talking, you savage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.17,0:19:11.33,Main - Top,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wait! Even if you do this—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.45,0:19:14.12,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,I was willing to show mercy by simply\Ndemonstrating God's power,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.12,0:19:15.42,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,but you had to get uppity!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.42,0:19:19.01,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,So be it! You may feel His \Nwrath for yourself, and repent!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.38,0:19:23.85,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Feuk Um! Feu louv! Omgab! Vefshiv!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.09,0:19:25.43,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,That fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.43,0:19:26.39,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,In Vif!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.04,0:19:35.15,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Veor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.49,0:19:39.44,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,God's wrath finds it's mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.44,0:19:42.16,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Come along now, Lady Serafina!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:48.15,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Lukewarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.37,0:19:53.47,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Veor...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:57.26,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Your projectiles are not \Nnearly enough to pierce armor
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.26,0:19:59.06,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,that is fortified with willpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:01.67,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,If you want to kill me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.94,0:20:05.68,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,then take up a blade and use it to \Nsever my head from my shoulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.62,0:20:13.19,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I was happy to see that you were \Nin no rush to return home, Sera.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.83,0:20:23.95,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,G-G-Get away from Lady Serafina, \Nyou ignorant barbarian!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.95,0:20:28.08,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Cease this foolishness, \Nbefore you come to regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.08,0:20:31.21,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Begging for your life will not save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:34.60,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Omgab!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.08,0:20:36.41,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Feu louv!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.09,0:20:40.15,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Vefshiv! Feuk Um!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.49,0:20:42.99,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:46.09,Main,Vyu,0,0,0,,The vitality of the land \Nis being used up...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.44,0:20:49.54,Main,Vyu,0,0,0,,The nature of the earth and \Ntrees is becoming twisted...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.89,0:20:56.83,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Sera. That woman \Ncannot be saved, at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.38,0:20:59.95,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Time is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.13,0:21:05.11,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Let God's wrath fall upon the barbarian!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.07,0:21:09.12,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.43,0:21:10.62,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Malcius!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.62,0:21:12.66,Main,Radil,0,0,0,,Retinue Priest Malcius!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.42,0:21:19.50,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,Is this barbarian sorcery?! \NHow revolting! Unhand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.50,0:21:21.75,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Malcius, I'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.03,0:21:23.07,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Don't, Sera!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.38,0:21:24.76,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Don't stop me, Veor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.99,0:21:29.98,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,The blame may be hers, but I can't simply \Nwatch as one of my people is killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.98,0:21:31.76,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It isn't a matter of blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.10,0:21:34.77,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,The blight... has manifested.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.56,0:21:40.78,Main,Malcius,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:47.58,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,That's a Fiend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.91,0:21:49.03,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,A Fiend?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.54,0:22:05.09,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,So, this is a Fiend...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.85,0:22:13.64,Sign_Basic,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(750,625)\shad0\fs11\bord1\c&HBACBD0&\3c&H506972&\b1\blur1\pos(546,244)}Translation: Lee Francis\N\NTiming: Andy Ellis\N\NEditing: Zachary Carlysle\N\NQuality Control: Salem Alabanza\N\NTranslation Check: Sho Stifler
